{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "031dba7493bd2f63d4d597c752264f626d8aaa93f44ba0053287b75c06bbddbf", "ja": "ふわぁ……。あっ、{$P$}。\nおはようございますぅ……。朝のお散歩ですか？", "zh": "呼啊……啊，{$P$}。\n早安……你在做晨间散步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f039eb778f4aa648a2d4130cbad2af773daeca02752069745ce729c913adfdf0", "ja": "ああ、おはよう雪歩。泊まりがけのロケは大変だけど、\n今日もみんなで頑張っていこうな。", "zh": "嗯，早安啊，雪步。虽然参与需要外宿的外景很辛苦，\n但今天也跟大家一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5133df414cce101cb924f0d1415f5a13f0e63432592fb2a70fb84c51fa23ba61", "ja": "はい、今日も一日、よろしくお願いします。\nえへへっ。", "zh": "好的，今天一天也请你多多指教，\n嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "676d58b709ec48c889ecd8bb84c27e6fa6797d17bc4a7716f499f1be2630861d", "ja": "でも、ちゃんと眠れたのか？　昨日の夜は、\nアイドルみんなで盛り上がったって聞いたけど。", "zh": "不过你有睡饱吗？我听说昨天晚上\n偶像们似乎在一起玩得很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "14f3256c5d3e611906ec0ca4581700cbd1c4d0e5e1841a7cda15eac89b2e5ba5", "ja": "いえ、パジャマパーティーはしましたけど、すぐに\nみんな、仕事があるからって寝ちゃいましたから。", "zh": "不，虽然有举办睡衣派对，\n但因为还有工作的关系，大家很早就睡了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e03104b745a6d8d3cacedfd12cffe3a1c5598893480edfce237a4bddee4c8ad2", "ja": "おっ、なかなかしっかりしてるじゃないか。\nこれも雪歩がいたおかげかな？", "zh": "哦，大家都很认真呢。\n这也是多亏了有雪步在场吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e9dfe86757f98f466e78a8c39e642137f66c43db5cbcf5feb0b48dc6acfdfc5d", "ja": "そ、そんな、みんながしっかりしてるだけで。\n私がいてもいなくても、関係ないですよぉ。", "zh": "没、没这回事，是因为大家本来就很认真，\n跟我在不在场无关啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7f3b76fd2055cfd19738e4b2dcfa2ac567eb5ec50fe6033dfb2df919d9ed4b79", "ja": "それに私、本当はもっとおしゃべりしたかったなぁって\n思ったんです。……お仕事がなければ、ですけど。", "zh": "而且我其实也想跟大家多聊一点……\n前提是没有要工作的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "288e7734f808d4544850fc5231eb71cf99d5aa5f9e48027183ece61450376dcb", "ja": "劇場のみんなと……、それから……。", "zh": "不只是跟剧场的伙伴们……也想跟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1009_p", "source_sha256": "291ef5aa20b8e1cf201971480086c879f66cfc7452c66f3f8f930e77a010515d", "ja": "おっと、ここの朝食は食べ放題ビュッフェ形式らしい。\n雪歩、なくなる前に早く行こう！", "zh": "哦，这边的早餐好像是吃到饱的自助餐呢。\n雪步，我们趁东西被吃完之前赶快去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0c9aef3e411d5b1b03b80d5e6f3b934fa5e82d56c1429275a8d58a5981b620e5", "ja": "あ……。は、はいぃ。", "zh": "啊……好、好的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bcffee8894a52a7a8aac2d18fa8ec1ed28886a93db068a0df6f3f7e3e43b33dd", "ja": "あ、そういえば雪歩、\nさっき何か言いかけてなかったっけ？", "zh": "啊，话说回来，\n雪步你刚才是不是有话还没说完？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0023_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c65894cad61834cf5ebb4e8d82d038ce6563e64183209e9854a0947f5a51f3d0", "ja": "な、なんでもありません！\nわ、私、環ちゃん達を起こしてきますね～！", "zh": "没、没什么！\n我、我去叫小环她们起床喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
